{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1412255-2e-gods-with-more-callings","id":1412255,"title":"[2E] Gods with more Callings","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-09-06T04:29:11-07:00","id":1412255,"title":"[2E] Gods with more Callings","content":"So the showing of Titan Callings in <b>Titanomachy</b> book \u2013 i.e. <i>Adversary, Destroyer, Monster, Primeval, Tyrant</i> \u2013 made some commotion in fandom ( see <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1411612-scion-2e-demigod-kickstarter?p=1412220#post1412220\">here</a> and <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1411304-scion-titanomachy-pdf?p=1412211#post1412211\">here</a> ) because some fans feel original Gods should have Titan's Calling in their own write-up. To name example, famous Deva Kali should be Destroyer, of course. This rewritten pointed me that maybe even other Callings should be added to original Gods from official Pantheons to this day. Write you collection of Callings for each proposed God and why do you think it should have extra Callings than those already listed. \ud83d\ude0e<br /> <br /> Remember, listening Titan Calling can be base for contestation in larger Gods society that particular diving is Titan \u2013 it\u2019s more political accusation than real evidence, but Gods can always rise it in setting.<br /> <br /> Here is my example:<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b>Deva - <i>Kali, the Dark Mother</i></b></span><br /> <b>Callings:</b> Guardian, Liminal, Warrior, Destroyer<br /> <b>Reason</b>: One of official titles of Kali is simply the Destroyer. Read more about her cult why. \ud83d\ude09","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 09-06-2020, 07:32 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-06T05:13:43-07:00","id":1412262,"title":"","content":"When I proposed my God of Halloween idea I had to settle on three of the four appropriate callings (Sage, Trickster, and Liminal) in but Guardian was a perfect fit too. And the four together far more logical than any of the three alone. If we move to the profound complexity of many mythological deities, yes some have half a dozen Callings at least.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-06T07:38:26-07:00","id":1412279,"title":"","content":"In this case, three seems to be the logical middle ground. Some Gods, like the Trimurti, could probably have as many as 5 Callings if you cite specific passages, while some gods are so niche that they probably should only have one Calling. And when it comes to PC Balance then it gets dicier where some players may want 5 Callings because their Patron does.<br /> <br /> You also run into things where you have to ask if you assign them based on noteworthy things or if you give anybody who's ever held a sword Warrior. Like the Tuatha: Many Tuatha know how to fight, but some of them are especially good at it. This also shows up in Purviews as well. ALL the Theoi are more inhumanly beautiful than any mortal could be. They're dazzling. However, even among them, some are especially so. So do you give all Theoi Beauty, or do you give Apollo and Aphrodite (and while I don't believe Apollo has Beauty in the Hero book he should) to denote &quot;Even for a very pretty Pantheon, they are ESPECIALLY so&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-06T07:52:33-07:00","id":1412282,"title":"","content":"Those multiple callings may be due to multiple Mantels that the god have, while still being the same in the myths. Let\u2019s say Mars to the Romans can be Mars Pater that would have the Creator calling, Mars Gradivus that would have the Leader calling, but in the myths both are still Mars, not Ares.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-06T23:25:17-07:00","id":1412398,"title":"","content":"Adversary\u2019s a dangerous Calling for a trickster figure to slip into. It\u2019s possible that Loki will become an Adversary, or perhaps that he already is and is hiding it. Tawiscara is on the brink, as is perhaps a certain of Set\u2019s mantles and that wily one, Tezcatlipoca.<br /> <br /> Destroyer\u2019s tricky, beyond the obvious Shiva and Kali, but you know what should be obvious? Giving Sekhmet and \u012atzp\u0101p\u0101l\u014dtl Monster.<br /> <br /> Primordial fits a few gods, too: Varuna and Zam, most notably.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12958-raz_fox","name":"Raz_Fox","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"42"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-08T05:48:12-07:00","id":1412579,"title":"","content":"<b>Scion Demigod </b>Kickstarter manuscript have official list of Gods with Titanic Callings that should be in <b>Origin</b> and <b>Hero</b> updated.<br /> <br /> <i><b>Titanic Callings in Hero </b><br /> The creation of Titanic Callings as a system topic postdates the Gods featured in the pantheons of <b>Hero</b>. Conceptually speaking, if you\u2019re going to let half-Titans into some pantheons, you probably have to acknowledge the ones who should already be present in the game \u2014 it\u2019s only fair.<br /> <br /> The following isn\u2019t a complete list, but just the most obvious Gods. Any God with a monstrous countenance or deeply inhuman aspect has the potential for a Titanic Calling; Certainly, many pantheons like the Shen will have legitimate members who are Titans, or possess Titanic Callings. Storyguide should feel free to treat some Gods with exceptions, however; for example, Ares\u2019 Mantles of Mars still treat associated his Callings as Guardian, Lover, Warrior, while the various component goddesses who make up the Morrigan may take turns swapping Mantles to make sure none get too monstrous.<br /> <br /> Full rules for playing with these Callings are available in <b>Titanomachy</b>, while full rules for playing Scions with a Titanic heritage are available in <b>Saints and Monsters</b>.<br /> <br /> <b>Agni: </b>Primeval<br /> <b>Ares:</b> Destroyer<br /> <b>Shiva: </b>Destroyer<br /> <b>Itzpapalotl: </b>Monster, Primeval<br /> <b>The Morrigan:</b> Destroyer, Monster<br /> <b>Tawiscara: </b>Adversary </i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 09-09-2020, 09:53 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-09T06:01:13-07:00","id":1412707,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#FF0000\">A clarification that short summaries of stuff from books written out is fine. Try not to copy whole cloth and never post a photo. This is fine. </span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 09-09-2020, 08:23 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-09T08:31:53-07:00","id":1412722,"title":"","content":"I think cases where more three Mantles are really good fits for Gods can probably be handled via Mantles having slightly different lineups of three from each other. Zeus has his stern father force of law itself Mantle with Judge, but that's not usually Scions' Divine Parent because it's incarnations with his Leader, Lover, Trickster Mantle that are constantly turning into animals to get laid and father Scions on mortals.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 09-09-2020, 11:35 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}